    // dmg_to_monster = ATKY + add_ATK - DEFM >= HPM
    // add_ATK >= HPM + DEFM - ATKY
    // Max value: 100 + 100 - 1 = 199.
    // So iterating add_ATK up to 200 is safe.

    // Similarly for DEF, max useful add_DEF is when dmg_to_yang becomes 0.
    // ATKM - (DEFY + add_DEF) <= 0 => add_DEF >= ATKM - DEFY.
    // Max value: 100 - 1 = 99.
    // So iterating add_DEF up to 100 is safe.

    // Let's redo with safer bounds.
